	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 332px;">Nickname:    </td>
			<td style="width: 267px;">KB</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 332px;">Hobbies:</td>
			<td style="width: 267px;">Video Games, Golf, and Fishing</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 332px;">Favorite Food:</td>
			<td style="width: 267px;">My mom’s homemade Chicken Alfredo.</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 332px;">Why did you choose USCL?</td>
			<td style="width: 267px;">I chose USCL because it was an opportunity for me to come see the east coast of America and it has a great Academic Program.</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 332px;">What tip(s) or strategies would you have for a prospective student athlete thinking about coming to USCL?</td>
			<td style="width: 267px;">Stay ahead of your classes and do the work.</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 332px;">What are your plans after USCL?</td>
			<td style="width: 267px;">Transfer to a four year university and play baseball.</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

